  "title": "Grandma's Italian Pizzelle Cookies",
  "description": "Copy Grandma's traditional technique for Italian pizzelles using a basic dough pressed in a pizzelle iron and dusted with powdered sugar.",
  "authors": [
    "Elaine K"
  ],
